END

SCRIPT:BreeTomBom01
"Get out, you old wight! Vanish in the sunlight! Shrivel like the cold mist, like the winds go wailing, Come never here again! Leave your barrow empty!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_bombadil001
"Get out, you old wight! Vanish in the sunlight! Shrivel like the cold mist, like the winds go wailing, Out into the barren lands far beyond the mountains!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_bombadil002
"Come never here again! Leave your barrow empty!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_bombadil003
